    family-names: Zhang
    alias: Erwin Zhang
abstract: >-
  A native macOS port, in Swift, of logisim-evolution 4.1.0:
  educational software for designing and simulating digital
  logic circuits.
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: 'https://github.com/erwinzhang7/logisim-evolved'
keywords:
  - digital logic
  - circuit simulation
  - computer organisation
  - education
  - macOS
